00:12:49.710 --> 00:12:51.660
Book Room

00:12:57.500 --> 00:13:02.130
Sensei. I tried writing a short story
in a genre that I've never written about before.

00:13:05.330 --> 00:13:09.380
I'm thinking of writing one short story
per week from now on.

00:13:09.380 --> 00:13:12.540
I will make sure that it doesn't interfere
with my studying. So...

00:13:15.040 --> 00:13:17.580
I'm strict, you know? With my corrections.

00:13:20.670 --> 00:13:25.880
There may be some sudden turbulence, so please keep
your seatbelts fastened at all times while seated.

00:13:26.290 --> 00:13:28.540
This plane is now headed to Naha Airport...

00:14:01.630 --> 00:14:03.790
Yum! This rafute rocks!

00:14:03.790 --> 00:14:06.750
These island shallots are crispy-crunchy
and delicious too!

00:14:10.330 --> 00:14:12.790
Nat-chan... Okay?

00:14:12.790 --> 00:14:13.580
Huh?

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:16.250
Muah!

00:14:18.710 --> 00:14:20.580
Al! What's wrong?!

00:14:21.250 --> 00:14:25.540
Koregusu. It's a seasoning made by infusing
island chili peppers with awamori liquor-

00:14:25.540 --> 00:14:27.670
Muah!

00:14:28.380 --> 00:14:30.000
That's enough!

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:32.460
St-stop that!
Sensei, come on. Relax.

00:14:33.080 --> 00:14:35.420
Make sure not to go out beyond the swimming zones.

00:14:35.420 --> 00:14:36.630
Now then, dismissed.

00:14:38.130 --> 00:14:39.670
Cute!

00:14:39.670 --> 00:14:40.580
Cool!

00:14:50.080 --> 00:14:51.500
Here goes, Hina-chan!

00:14:51.500 --> 00:14:53.540
Hina-sensei! Oh!

00:14:56.790 --> 00:14:57.920
You got a sec?

00:15:02.630 --> 00:15:03.670
Rui...

00:15:03.960 --> 00:15:05.710
Hina-nee, you're a teacher, you know.

00:15:06.080 --> 00:15:07.960
What's up with that indecent swimsuit?

00:15:08.580 --> 00:15:09.670
Rui...

00:15:09.830 --> 00:15:12.670
You finally talked to me! I'm sorry.

00:15:12.670 --> 00:15:15.330
And even after I'd said that stuff to you, Rui,
about how Natsuo-kun is our family.

00:15:15.330 --> 00:15:17.420
I'm a failure as a big sister!

00:15:18.500 --> 00:15:20.460
Even as I thought that I shouldn't...

00:15:20.460 --> 00:15:23.790
when you told me, Rui, about your feelings
for Natsuo-kun... I lost my self-control and...

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:27.630
It's fine, really. I decided to start disliking him anyway.

00:15:27.630 --> 00:15:28.790
I don't want that either!

00:15:28.790 --> 00:15:31.250
Huh?! Then what do you want me to do?!

00:15:31.460 --> 00:15:34.250
I'll... break up with Natsuo-kun.

00:15:34.710 --> 00:15:38.670
If I'd just suppressed my feelings, then this wouldn't
have happened in the first place, right?

00:15:38.670 --> 00:15:42.420
Rui, as you continued to ignore me,
I was regretting what I had done...

00:15:42.830 --> 00:15:46.130
If things had just stayed the same,
the three of us could've gotten along great forever...

00:15:46.630 --> 00:15:47.710
Ow!

00:15:48.170 --> 00:15:50.210
That doesn't seem right...

00:15:50.500 --> 00:15:53.960
Even if the two of you break up,
if your feelings don't change, it's the same thing.

00:15:53.960 --> 00:15:58.040
I can now understand that there are feelings
that you just can't put a stop to.

00:15:58.960 --> 00:16:01.630
So, I'm not thinking that I want you to break up.

00:16:01.830 --> 00:16:03.670
It might be complicated for you, Hina-nee, but...

00:16:03.880 --> 00:16:05.250
You're not angry anymore?

00:16:05.420 --> 00:16:06.750
I'm not angry.

00:16:06.750 --> 00:16:07.920
Have we made up?

00:16:10.500 --> 00:16:11.210
Yeah.

00:16:14.580 --> 00:16:16.580
Rui!

00:16:17.540 --> 00:16:19.080
Hey, where should we go next?

00:16:19.080 --> 00:16:20.500
I wanna go somewhere that's really Okinawan.

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:23.210
Aw man! And this is our precious last day here!

00:16:23.210 --> 00:16:25.420
I wanted to see girls in swimsuits at the beach again!

00:16:25.420 --> 00:16:27.170
Oh! It says they're coral accessories!

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:28.420
No way! They're so pretty!

00:16:28.420 --> 00:16:29.500
So cute!

00:16:29.630 --> 00:16:30.920
Have your boyfriend buy one for you!

00:16:30.920 --> 00:16:31.960
That's right!

00:16:31.960 --> 00:16:34.170
What?! It's embarrassing, stop that.

00:16:34.170 --> 00:16:35.250
Lucky!

00:16:35.250 --> 00:16:36.670
I want a boyfriend, too.

00:16:36.670 --> 00:16:37.290
Right?!

00:16:38.540 --> 00:16:41.250
So, how was your first time being in charge?

00:16:41.250 --> 00:16:46.750
At first, I was excited, but in actuality,
I couldn't relax as I was worried about the students.

00:16:46.750 --> 00:16:50.920
So true. When you get home,
the exhaustion is going to hit you hard.

00:16:50.920 --> 00:16:52.920
Please don't scare me!

