00:17:17.750 --> 00:17:19.580
Huh? Where'd Natsuo go?

00:17:28.330 --> 00:17:29.250
Sensei...

00:17:29.250 --> 00:17:33.210
I wanted to see you badly... There's something
that I just have to talk to you about, Sensei...

00:17:33.210 --> 00:17:34.630
Me, too...

00:17:36.540 --> 00:17:39.630
I think... it's better if we break up.
I want... you to get serious about me.

00:17:39.960 --> 00:17:40.710
Huh?

00:17:41.380 --> 00:17:44.040
Hold on, time-out! Uh... Wait, what?!

00:17:44.540 --> 00:17:46.290
It's my fault.

00:17:46.290 --> 00:17:49.290
I shouldn't have let this turn into
this kind of relationship in the first place.

00:17:49.630 --> 00:17:54.170
As the adult, I should've had my act together,
but I got carried away by the heat of the moment and...

00:17:54.460 --> 00:17:57.670
I think that if we stay like this,
it'll do no good for either one of us.

00:17:58.500 --> 00:17:59.630
So...

00:17:59.880 --> 00:18:02.330
if it's right now, we can still turn back, so...

00:18:02.330 --> 00:18:04.130
Is that all you have to say?

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:08.960
Well, I object to all of that anyway.

00:18:08.960 --> 00:18:09.920
"Object"?!

00:18:09.920 --> 00:18:13.920
Sensei, it seems like you want
to treat me like a kid forever.

00:18:13.920 --> 00:18:16.250
I am actually thinking about the future too, you know?

00:18:16.880 --> 00:18:18.710
This time it's my turn.

00:18:21.130 --> 00:18:23.080
This is my rebuttal.

00:18:24.580 --> 00:18:26.960
Sensei, you may be worried, but...

00:18:26.960 --> 00:18:31.580
please don't decide by yourself and use age or relations
as reasons that it wouldn't be good for my sake.

00:18:32.420 --> 00:18:37.630
That has nothing to do with the fact
that I fell in love with the woman you are, Sensei...

00:18:38.290 --> 00:18:39.710
Natsuo-kun...

00:18:43.920 --> 00:18:44.920
Wow...!

00:18:53.880 --> 00:18:54.920
So pretty...

00:18:56.830 --> 00:18:59.330
I can only give you a cheap one right now, but...

00:18:59.880 --> 00:19:02.790
I'll work, so that the next one I give you is a proper one...

00:19:02.790 --> 00:19:06.330
So... some day in the future, marry me, Hina.

00:19:10.630 --> 00:19:11.710
First time...

00:19:13.290 --> 00:19:16.040
That's the first time you actually called me by my name.

00:19:21.380 --> 00:19:24.920
Hina. Hina. Hina...

00:19:26.790 --> 00:19:28.830
Hina. Is it okay...?

00:19:39.380 --> 00:19:41.330
Your arm's gonna fall asleep, you know?

00:19:41.330 --> 00:19:43.540
This was a dream of mine.

00:19:43.540 --> 00:19:45.170
What? Being an arm pillow?

00:19:45.170 --> 00:19:47.420
I've wanted to ask you this but...

00:19:47.420 --> 00:19:50.630
Hina, since when did you start having feelings for me?

00:19:50.630 --> 00:19:53.460
When...? Well...

00:19:53.460 --> 00:19:58.330
I realized that my feelings had intensified
and reached the point of no return when...

00:19:58.330 --> 00:20:00.460
I saw you kissing Rui that time, but...

00:20:01.420 --> 00:20:03.540
But when I look back...

00:20:03.540 --> 00:20:06.250
it started when we often talked on the school's rooftop.

00:20:07.330 --> 00:20:10.710
At that time I was still with Shuu-san
and you were a student,

00:20:10.710 --> 00:20:13.130
and I just thought it was more like than love.

00:20:13.130 --> 00:20:18.540
That's unexpected... I thought you wouldn't be able
to forget Hagiwara-san for a while.

00:20:19.380 --> 00:20:22.710
Well... I did love him, so I was worried about him.

00:20:22.710 --> 00:20:27.540
I'd also heard that he wasn't getting along with his wife.
But it's not like I have regrets.

00:20:27.540 --> 00:20:28.250
Really?

00:20:28.250 --> 00:20:30.750
Really! Why're you doubting me?!

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:36.170
Well... That is... When you were masturbating,
you called out Hagiwara-san's name so...

00:20:36.170 --> 00:20:36.920
What?!

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:38.250
Y-you saw me?!

00:20:38.250 --> 00:20:39.630
B-by accident.

00:20:39.920 --> 00:20:43.880
No! How mortifying!

00:20:44.040 --> 00:20:49.420
N-now now... After I saw you,
I did jerk off in my room, too, so...

00:20:49.710 --> 00:20:51.380
Th-that was...

00:20:51.380 --> 00:20:54.960
Well, it's not as if I could have done it
with you in mind, Natsuo-kun.

00:20:54.960 --> 00:20:57.670
So, I had no choice but to think of Shuu-san and...

00:20:58.170 --> 00:21:02.960
At the time, I was desperate to hold back any feelings
I was having towards you, Natsuo-kun!

00:21:02.960 --> 00:21:03.750
Oh God!

00:21:03.880 --> 00:21:06.170
I'm so embarrassed I can't look at you anymore!

00:21:07.500 --> 00:21:08.500
So cute!

00:21:10.380 --> 00:21:14.630
Hey, Natsuo-kun. I know I asked you earlier
if I could get my hopes up, but...

00:21:14.630 --> 00:21:17.830
it's fine to tell me if you end up
falling for someone else, okay?

00:21:17.830 --> 00:21:21.670
What's up with that? Never gonna happen.
The next time you say that, I'll get angry, you know?

00:21:23.330 --> 00:21:24.250
Sorry...

00:21:29.330 --> 00:21:30.380
Tachibana-sensei.

00:21:30.710 --> 00:21:31.670
Yes...?

00:21:32.130 --> 00:21:35.580
The head teacher said, "I have to talk to you,
so please come to the conference room."

00:21:35.580 --> 00:21:37.750
Oh, sure. Understood.

00:21:39.790 --> 00:21:43.000
Is this about the test problems I submitted yesterday?

00:21:43.000 --> 00:21:44.670
Was there something unsatisfactory about them...?

00:21:45.580 --> 00:21:46.750
Excuse me.

00:21:47.040 --> 00:21:50.540
Ah, Tachibana-sensei.
Please excuse me for summoning you.

00:21:50.790 --> 00:21:54.330
Not at all. Um... what was it you needed to talk about...?

00:21:54.750 --> 00:21:58.130
There's something I'd like you to look at.

00:21:58.750 --> 00:21:59.830
It's this.

00:22:08.080 --> 00:22:17.120
Ah kimi ni dake wagamama ni natte yuku

00:22:08.080 --> 00:22:17.120
Ah, I'll be selfish to you

00:22:20.040 --> 00:22:21.880
Domestic Girlfriend

00:22:22.170 --> 00:22:29.460
Sasai na hibi no nandemo nai yasashisa wo

00:22:22.170 --> 00:22:29.460
Your little kindness in normal days

00:22:30.870 --> 00:22:39.040
Daiji ni shimatte nandomo akete nagamete iru

00:22:30.870 --> 00:22:39.040
I cherish them and open them often to look

00:22:39.620 --> 00:22:47.920
Kimi no honshin kikezu ni karamawari shitari shite

00:22:39.620 --> 00:22:47.920
I wouldn't be able to ask you about your feelings and losing my self

00:22:48.080 --> 00:22:56.210
Kantan na koto hodo muzukashiku natte iru

00:22:48.080 --> 00:22:56.210
The easiest things become harder to do

00:22:57.120 --> 00:23:00.170
Otona ni nareba

00:22:57.120 --> 00:23:00.170
If I become an adult,

00:23:01.500 --> 00:23:12.670
Konna koto de nayamazu ni umaku ikirareru kana

00:23:01.500 --> 00:23:12.670
I can live well without worrying about something like this?

00:23:13.500 --> 00:23:17.920
Ah kimi ni dake wagamama ni naru

00:23:13.500 --> 00:23:17.920
Ah, I become selfish just towards you

00:23:17.920 --> 00:23:22.120
Dondon jibun rashiku mo nakunatte

00:23:17.920 --> 00:23:22.120
I'll lose my self more & more

00:23:22.250 --> 00:23:26.670
Ah mata kimochi ga sakibashitte

00:23:22.250 --> 00:23:26.670
Ah, my feelings get ahead of myself again

00:23:26.670 --> 00:23:31.170
Dondon matomo ja nakunatteku kara

00:23:26.670 --> 00:23:31.170
I can't stand it more

00:23:31.170 --> 00:23:36.620
Sotchi wo minai de

00:23:31.170 --> 00:23:36.620
Don't look that way

00:23:38.830 --> 00:23:41.540
I'm sorry. I love you.
